  "reason": "The strongest evidence is RNA-only multiprofile scvi_n200, with avgpool and transformer nearly tied (0.650/0.628 vs 0.653/0.628), while image-only models are weak and multimodal fusion is untested. config_030 keeps the best RNA encoder/profile/aggregation from config_005 and adds only resnet50 image features with simple concat fusion, directly testing whether image provides complementary signal to the best RNA baseline. This is the best next use of budget because it exploits the most promising direction with a minimal, interpretable fusion test, and its comparison to config_005/006 will clarify whether multimodality helps or hurts before adding more complex image encoders or fusion schemes."
}

